  "lessons": [
    {
      "title": "Introducing ... Knit it Now Courses!",
      "slug": "introducing-knit-it-now-courses",
      "displayOrder": 10,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 360,
        "lessonOrder": 10
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\n\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/56/mitten_magic/mitten_course_thumb.png\">\r\n\r\nMittens are fun,quick and useful projects.<br>They give lots of opportunity to get creative with color and pattern. They are great for brushing up on your knitting skills<br>... and the best part? They are FAST!\r\n\r\n\n<iframe src='https://player.vimeo.com/video/264160581' frameborder='0' webkitAllowFullScreen mozallowfullscreen allowFullScreen></iframe>\n\r\n\r\nThis course is designed for you to <b>get experience with knitting mittens.</b> <br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"lead\"> <i class=\"fa fa-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> You will:</div>\r\n<ol class=\"instruction-nolist\">\r\n<li>Use the Knit Now Dynamic Mitten Pattern to create a custom pattern for YOUR machine, YOUR yarn and YOUR gauge</li>\r\n<li>Experiment with different mitten styles</li>\r\n<li>Learn/practice techniques used to create beautiful mittens that will be treasured by your friends and family.</li>\r\n<li>Your results will be a launching point for you to <b>get creative with color, texture, stitch patterns and design.</b></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"lead\"> <i class=\"fa fa-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>You need:</div>\r\n<ol class=\"instruction-nolist\">\r\n<li>Flat bed knitting machine (any gauge)</li>\r\n<li>Smooth, light colored yarn appropriate for your machine. (get fancy after you learn the basics</li>\r\n<li>Your knitting manual. <br>\r\n<em><small>Free copies of manuals can be found <a href=\"\">here</a></small></em></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<blockquote class=\"blockquote_style\">A commitment to dedicate time to this subject will go a long way.  Promise that you will set aside time to work through each lesson ... not just watch and read ... but KNIT!</blockquote>\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 5215,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "Start Here",
