    {
      "title": "Construction Overview",
      "slug": "construction-overview",
      "displayOrder": 20,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 361,
        "lessonOrder": 20
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Here's an overview of a basic mitten:<br>\r\nIn the course we will:<br>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Go into detail for each section of the mitten</li>\r\n<li>Explore options for each section</li>\r\n<li>Discuss adding stitch patterns and texture</li>\r\n<li>Offer lots of exercises and practice</li>\r\n<li>Put in the time and you'll be a mitten expert in no time!</li>\r\n</ul>",
              "legacyComponentId": 5217,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "151857559",
              "title": "Gorgeous Gored Mittens",
              "legacyComponentId": 5218,
              "order": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<div class=\"lead\">Let's get started!</div>\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 5219,
              "order": 3
            }
          ],
          "title": "Overview",
          "slug": "overview",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 3626,
            "blockType": "Video"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "With Knit it Now Dynamic Patterns you can:<ul>\r\n<li>Use any knitting machine</li>\r\n<li>Use any yarn <em><small>(appropriate for your machine)</small></em></li>\r\n<li>Choose from a wide range of sizes</li>\r\n<li>Use the pattern again and again</li>\r\n</ul>",
